.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt ISA_LEGACY 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm isa_legacy
.Nd legacy ISA enumeration for fixed-resource systems
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In kern/isa.h
.Ft void
.Fn isa_init void
.Ft void
.Fn isa_probe_legacy void
.Ft int
.Fn isa_port_alive "uint16_t port"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The ISA legacy framework provides fixed-resource discovery for machines without
PCI enumeration, including older 486-class systems. It probes standard ISA-era
port ranges such as UART, LPT, IDE, and PS/2 controller locations and registers
present devices on the ISA bus.
.Sh SEE ALSO
